[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "林可来的时候，浑身湿透了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still the coffee",
    "spoken_dialogue": "进来。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她站在咖啡店门口，头发贴在脸上，雨水从发梢滴下来，在地板上形成一小滩水渍。她没打伞。\n\"进来。\"苏念说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks through the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你昨天挂了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "林可走进来。她的鞋在地板上踩出湿脚印，一步一步延伸到吧台前。\n苏念递给她一条毛巾。林可接过去，擦了擦脸，但没擦头发。毛巾被她攥在手里，攥成了一团。\n\"你昨天挂了"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke sits down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我知道。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我知道。\"林可的声音很轻。她坐到吧台前的高脚凳上，凳子发出一声吱呀。\"我挂了之后，在家坐了两个小时。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian pours water into a cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "苏念给她倒了一杯热水。水杯放在吧台上，热气升起来，模糊了林可的脸。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你说——我哥哥当年也是这样。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你说——我哥哥当年也是这样。\"苏念说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "林可的手指在杯壁上停了一下。她的指甲是彩色的——今天是蓝色，上面画着小星星。但指甲的边缘有咬过的痕迹。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke speaks softly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你有哥哥。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你有哥哥。\"林可说。她的声音比平时慢，每个字都像是在称重。\"你有一个哥哥。比你大三岁。叫苏远。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我不记得。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "苏念的手停在吧台上。\n\"我不记得。\"她说。\n\"我知道你不记得。\"林可抬头看着她。她的眼睛是红的——不是哭过，是没睡。\"因为你把关于他的记忆——全部读掉了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "什么意思？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的呼吸停了一秒。\n\"什么意思？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke turns hand over to inspect",
    "spoken_dialogue": "这是你和苏远。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "林可从包里拿出手机，翻到一张照片。照片里是两个小孩——一个男孩，一个女孩，站在咖啡店门口。男孩大概八九岁，女孩五六岁。男孩的手搭在女孩肩膀上，两个人都在笑。\n\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着照片。男孩的脸是清晰的——圆脸，短发，笑起来眼睛弯弯的。她不认识这张脸。\n但女孩的脸——是她自己。五六岁的她，齐刘海，缺了一颗门牙。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏远——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"苏远——\"苏念的声音有点哑，\"他怎么了？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke places down the phone",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "林可把手机放下。她的手指在屏幕上划了一下，翻到另一张照片。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Yuan",
    "action_visual": "Su Yuan gazes at the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏远之墓",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Yuan",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "这张照片是黑白的。一个墓碑。墓碑上写着：\"苏远之墓\"。日期是十年前。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke speaks softly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "他死了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"他死了。\"林可说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "怎么死的？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那个墓碑。她的心跳在加速，但她的脸上什么表情都没有。\n\"怎么死的？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "他也有'能力'。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "林可的手在发抖。她把手机翻过来，屏幕朝下，按在吧台上。\n\"他也有'能力'。\"林可说。\"和你一样——他能听到别人听不到的东西。但他听到的不是心声——是未来。他能听"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "代价呢？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念的手指在吧台上敲了一下。\n\"代价呢？\"\n\"代价——\"林可的声音在发抖，\"代价是他的过去。每听到一次未来，他就忘掉一段过去。和你一样——忘掉的不是随机的记忆，"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "他忘掉了什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的胃在翻搅。\n\"他忘掉了什么？\"\n\"他忘掉了爸妈。\"林可说。\"忘掉了外婆。忘掉了你。最后——他忘掉了自己是谁。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the window",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "窗外的雨更大了。雨点打在铁皮雨棚上，声音密集得像机关枪。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "然后呢？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"然后呢？\"苏念问。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke hears a sound",
    "spoken_dialogue": "然后——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"然后——\"林可的手指在吧台上划了一道，\"他最后一次使用'能力'。他听到了自己的死期。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian digs fingernails into palm",
    "spoken_dialogue": "他听到了什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的指甲陷进掌心。\n\"他听到了什么？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "handwriting",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "林可没回答。她从包里抽出一张纸——一张折叠了很多次的纸，边缘已经泛黄。她把纸展开，推到苏念面前。\n是一封信。手写的，字迹歪歪扭扭的，像是写字的人手在发抖。\n*\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "*你看到这封信的时候，我已经不在了。*"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks out the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Shock",
    "source_text": "*我听到了。三月十五号，下午四点，念想咖啡店门口。一辆卡车。*\n*我不知道该怎么阻止。我试过了——那天我把自己锁在房间里，不出门。但三月十五号下午三点五十分，我"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "苏念的手指在信纸上停了三秒。信纸的边缘被她的指尖压出了一道折痕。\n死前三天。他把信交给了林可。但苏念——\n林可的嘴唇动了一下，像是在做一个很难的决定。然后她说："
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "全没了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 30,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian tears roll down cheeks",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "林可的眼泪掉下来了。她没擦，任由泪水顺着脸颊滑进嘴角。她说——你哥哥让她答应他。如果你忘了他，就别再提了。他说，忘了比记得好。忘了就不会痛了。\n苏念看着林可。林"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 31,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "back of hand",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "你今天为什么告诉我？苏念问。\n因为你又在用了。林可用手背擦了一下眼睛。你又在喝别人的咖啡，又在忘掉东西。我不能看着你走你哥哥的路。\n苏念把信纸折好，放进围裙口袋"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 32,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏念。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "林可低头看了看，把毛巾放在吧台上。她走到门口，停下来。\n\"苏念。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 33,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念抬头。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 34,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke draws latte art in the foam",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你哥哥最后那天——他出门之前，回头看了一眼念想的招牌。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "\"你哥哥最后那天——他出门之前，回头看了一眼念想的招牌。\"林可的声音在发抖，\"他说——'小念的拉花比我好。'\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 35,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian turns and leaves",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "门开了。风铃晃了两下。\n林可走了。雨还在下。\n苏念独自站在吧台后面。她的手在发抖，掌心被指甲掐出了血痕。血珠渗出来，滴在地板上，被雨水打湿的地板上多了几个深色的"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 36,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian reaches out to touch gently",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她走到镜子前。\n镜子里的那个人——圆脸，齐肩短发，围裙。\n她伸手摸了摸镜子里的脸。\n镜子里的人没回答。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 37,
    "space": "Physical",
